|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260414/zhanbao_image_1953050_1776114431_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260414/zhanbao_image_1953050_1776114431_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">利雅得新月点球战总比分5-7遭多哈萨德淘汰，无缘亚冠八强。</span></p><p><span style=" 51, 51);">【比赛相关】</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-14/69dd58e09a94cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">争五激烈！英超积分榜：曼联仍第3领先蓝军7分 第5至第10仅差6分</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140609181359.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140609181359_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140609181359_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">曼联仍排第三，与维拉同分，领先第六的切尔西7分。利兹联排第15，领先降级区6分。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-14/69dd4e75e9699native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">曼联雪上加霜！利桑德罗拉拽勒温头发，VAR介入后被直红罚下</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.84" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140413505864.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.84" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.84" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140413505864_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140413505864_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">曼联对阵利兹联。55分钟， VAR介入，主裁亲自观看回放，判罚利桑德罗拉拽勒温头发，将其红牌罚下。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-14/69dd5429edc70native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">这红牌对吗？利马拉拽头发但力度存疑，且勒温回手抓脖子动作在先</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.94" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140439266314.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.94" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.94" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140439266314_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140439266314_720.jpg"> </div><p>这判罚对吗？利马拉拽头发但力度是否构成暴力行为，有待商榷，而且在此之前，勒温在卡身位的时候先有一个回手抓住利马的脖子或脸颊的动作。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-14/69dd5bac740fenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">勒温成焦点！全场判罚争议：约罗倒地未吹，利马染红勒温也有动作</a></p><p><span style=" 0, 0);">曼联1-2不敌利兹联，本场不少判罚引发争议。勒温无疑是焦点人物。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-14/69dd620ab1b43native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">怒了！卡里克：约罗头被砸没判，利马染红是我见过最烂的判罚之一</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140537285262.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140537285262_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140537285262_720.jpg"> </div><p>本轮英超，曼联不敌利兹联，赛后，卡里克接受sky采访。卡里克对判罚表达了强烈质疑。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-14/69dd6234c4025native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">不满判罚！B费：规则对每个人都不一样 如果我谈论裁判会陷入麻烦</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140538477114.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140538477114.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140538477114.jpg"> </div><p>英超第32轮，曼联1-2不敌利兹联，B费赛后接受天空体育采访对判罚表示了不满。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-14/69dd5e5f5a87fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">勒温：规则不是我定的，我感觉到头发被拉了 不会记恨利马</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140522367677.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140522367677.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140522367677.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">勒温赛后接受了天空体育采访。关于判罚，他的回应很淡定。</span></p><p>【奎罗斯执教加纳】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-14/69dd38afb7ee2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">带队出战世界杯！官方：73岁前皇马、伊朗队主帅奎罗斯执教加纳</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.82" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/202604140242064815.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.82" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline;