sition: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250407/67f3e121e67a9.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250407/67f3e121e67a9.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">施洛特贝克此前已官宣与多特续约。德天空报道，施洛特贝克合同中5000万到6000万欧的解约金条款，在可激活球队方面也是有条件的。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-14/69dd1d6253acbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">敲警钟！镜报：若枪手失冠将是英超史上最大失败，塔帅会名声扫地</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.47" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/69dd1e8527ace.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.47" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.47" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/69dd1e8527ace.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260414/69dd1e8527ace.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">镜报撰文，该媒体强调了本赛季的英超冠军对于阿森纳的重要性，并表示，如果失冠，带来的结果将是无比沉重的。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-14/69dd2b374a46anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">重伤+热刺可能降级！电讯报：罗梅罗可能已为热刺踢完最后一场</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260413/69dd052ebfd38.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee;